eal para la toma de decisiones operativas y directivas.", "short_description": "AVCXR es una plataforma inmersiva de realidad mixta enfocada en revolucionar la capacitaci\u00f3n pr\u00e1ctica en los sectores de Educaci\u00f3n, Salud e Industria.\nEl impacto principal del proyecto es la democratizaci\u00f3n y descentralizaci\u00f3n del aprendizaje: mediante el uso de laboratorios remotos y m\u00f3dulos did\u00e1cticos inmersivos, AVCXR lleva oportunidades de educaci\u00f3n superior y entrenamiento en procesos industriales directamente a zonas rurales y comunidades vulnerables de dif\u00edcil acceso"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "AVCXR_MetaQuest.png", "id": "26575577285407797", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618284_26575577292074463_8179618092863187677_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JiQdOzB3h2UQ7kNvwG6bCS8&_nc_oc=AdqcnlWULvPWRQIglgqFFZOvmljWCy5M4CUBYe290rlbQKOCeROVf-Yix7S-3iUuoKw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQB18ET3DGg-1Eji2wlgNO7QtoQFL5S2J6DPhVamRFS1KA&oe=6A65F65E"}, {"file_name": "AVCXR_MetaQuest.png", "id": "3056063914782038", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499617850_3056063918115371_2202158384151631148_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9zJzlRJHCOUQ7kNvwEyZy1y&_nc_oc=AdrTlP0kdrakm7Qe-5dN1wFqmJn6C7SrQ_DuH3H4Rp2HBvAAxBNO6CIOKA4xoSz0vZw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDrGWOR_p_k8PAMzpU90z7WvTwgDKYfxR-JHeaIz3y5bw&oe=6A66064F"}, {"file_name": "AVCXR_MetaQuest_portrait.png", "id": "2473565366496707", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499296057_2473565369830040_7720233636311648977_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QbVKTr_9UOoQ7kNvwGmXKLM&_nc_oc=AdpUTz_kfkDSuCD-5Id40B2wvSKy9KiHCgxoUNk2BnS80-xv-A6vrF87p8wqWaLUPoQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscd